<title>KAZAKHSTAN: Kazakh tenge falls to 75.2500 to dlr.</title>
<headline>Kazakh tenge falls to 75.2500 to dlr.</headline>
<dateline>ALMATY 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The tenge closed at 75.2500 per dollar on the Kazakhstan Currency Exchange on Friday after 75.1800 on Thursday.</p>
